1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:03,221
When Jericho fell, one family walked out alive.

2
00:00:04,082 --> 00:00:05,262
Her name was Rahab.

3
00:00:05,982 --> 00:00:07,303
She lived in Jericho's wall.

4
00:00:07,903 --> 00:00:09,484
The Bible calls her a prostitute.

5
00:00:10,144 --> 00:00:12,505
Two spies came from God's people, Israel.

6
00:00:13,285 --> 00:00:15,266
She hid them, because she believed in their

7
00:00:15,306 --> 00:00:15,626
God.

8
00:00:16,107 --> 00:00:18,507
They told her: hang a red cord in your window,

9
00:00:18,788 --> 00:00:20,128
and your family will be safe.

10
00:00:21,909 --> 00:00:22,729
Israel marched.

11
00:00:23,029 --> 00:00:23,850
The people shouted.

12
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:26,211
And the wall fell down flat.

13
00:00:26,811 --> 00:00:28,431
Rahab and her family were spared.

14
00:00:28,912 --> 00:00:30,152
