15
00:00:30,672 --> 00:00:32,373
Trusting the promise saved her.

16
00:00:33,113 --> 00:00:35,955
A book of the Bible, Hebrews, says it in two

17
00:00:36,015 --> 00:00:37,555
words: By faith.

18
00:00:38,636 --> 00:00:41,297
She is named in the family line of Jesus, God's

19
00:00:41,337 --> 00:00:43,878
Son, who taketh away the sin of the world.

20
00:00:45,498 --> 00:00:47,179
Rahab could not stop a wall.

21
00:00:47,579 --> 00:00:49,320
She tied one cord to a promise.

22
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:52,821
Tie your trust to Jesus, and bring everyone

23
00:00:52,861 --> 00:00:53,862
